# src/apps/daemon/internal/networking/geoip

## Purpose
GeoIP and blocklist lookup primitives used by DNS and transport adapters.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `networking` (rank 2; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (6): `geoip.go`, `geoip_test.go`, `http_bounds.go`, `http_bounds_test.go`, `local.go`, `local_test.go`

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Go package: `geoip`.
- Notable exported surface: `IPMetadata`, `IsLocalOrLanIP`, `IsPrivateIP`, `NewService`, `ReverseDNS`, `Service`.
- Daemon-local dependencies: none.
- Direct daemon callers: `internal/adapters/api`, `internal/analysis/scanner`, `internal/integrations/sub`, `internal/networking/dns`, `internal/runtime/proxy`.

## Invariants
- `networking` code must not import a higher-rank daemon band.

